{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q25", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主个性及特色情况如何？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱丁卯、月柱癸丑、日柱甲子、时柱丁卯，日主甲木生于丑月，土旺木囚，但得子水正印生扶，时支卯木为根，年时天干双丁火伤官透出。甲木有根有印，伤官外露，性格上往往聪明、有才华，但伤官透干容易心高气傲、不拘小节，且月柱癸水正印与丑土财星相合，有贪图享受、依赖心强的倾向。日坐子水桃花，时支卯木也是桃花，桃花多主风流、异性缘佳。综合来看，甲木有印有根，不算自私，但伤官生财，有贪图安逸和风流之象，且印星贴身，遇事有依赖心理，但不怕事（伤官主胆气）。因此最符合的是“可靠，懒惰，不怕事，风流，女人缘好”。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q25", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_1_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3554, "response_id": "a4f6e4f5-2940-40b7-885b-a028abc0bb3a", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 236, "completion_tokens": 218, "total_tokens": 454, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 108}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q26", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的性格和出生如何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱癸丑、月柱庚申、日柱壬辰、时柱壬子。日主壬水生于申月，金白水清，得庚申印星生扶，又时柱壬子水旺，身强。年柱癸丑，劫财坐正官，月柱庚申偏印透干，时柱壬子比肩帮身。整体水势浩荡，金水相生，主聪明机智，足智多谋；月柱偏印透出，主有学识、仗义，但水旺无制，易固执己见。年柱癸丑，丑为财库，但被劫财癸水盖头，且月令申金生水，财星不显，故非大富之家，但年柱有库，出生家庭应属中等偏上，非贫穷。性格上，水旺之人外表温和，但内在刚强，非暴躁冲动，也非懒惰享乐。综合判断，最符合“足智多谋，为人仗义，但比较固执，出生在有钱家庭”的描述，但“有钱”程度需斟酌，因财星不显，更可能是家境殷实而非巨富，但选项中A最贴切。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q26", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_1_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3705, "response_id": "035dbae1-af11-4d8f-bf55-cba518880f00", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 262, "completion_tokens": 270, "total_tokens": 532, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 6}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q27", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主喜欢的居家装修风格是？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：日主壬水，生于申月得令，年柱癸丑、时柱壬子，水势极旺，金水相生，属于身强水旺的格局。水旺之人通常喜用火、土来调候与制衡，也喜木来泄秀。  \n\n从性格与审美看，水旺之人思维灵活、情感丰富，但有时会显得清冷或随性。命局中金水过重，缺乏火土，容易对温暖、厚重、有历史感或文化气息的事物产生向往，以平衡命局的寒湿之气。  \n\n选项分析：  \n- A（炫酷高科技）偏金水，与命局同气，可能不够吸引。  \n- B（欧式高贵典雅，古灵精怪摆设）有火土元素（欧式暖色、古董），且“古灵精怪”符合水旺之人的好奇与灵动，但欧式偏金，稍显不足。  \n- C（中式复古，古董风水物品）中式风格重木、土、火（红木、陶瓷、风水摆件），能补命局所需，且风水物品符合水旺之人对平衡气场的潜在需求，最为契合。  \n- D（环保极简）偏木水，但“极简”与“少摆设”不符合水旺之人喜欢丰富、有内涵环境的倾向。  \n\n综合判断，C选项最能补益命局并符合其潜在偏好。  \n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q27", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_1_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4564, "response_id": "6f0d18c5-7597-4dd6-9b90-5679a26713ca", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 240, "completion_tokens": 316, "total_tokens": 556, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 112}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "在丙辰大限（43–52），命主在哪一年出国创业？和什么领域相关？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱癸丑、月柱庚申、日柱壬辰、时柱壬子，日主壬水生于申月得令，金水两旺，身强喜木火土。丙辰大限（43-52岁，即2016-2025年），大运天干丙火为偏财，地支辰土为七杀，财杀相生，利于开拓事业。\n\n流年分析：\n- 2015乙未年（虚岁43，但大限从2016年开始，故2015仍在上一个乙卯大限，不符合丙辰大限范围，排除）。\n- 2017丁酉年：丁火正财透出，但酉金为印星，金旺生水，财星受泄，且酉辰合，但合化为金，不利财。\n- 2018戊戌年：戊土七杀透干，戌土为火库，且与命局辰土相冲，冲动事业宫，主变动、远行。戌中藏丁火正财，且大运丙火偏财透出，财星有力，适合创业。戌为燥土，与饮食（火土）相关，但更偏向房地产（土）或酒店（土金）。\n- 2019己亥年：己土正官，亥水为比肩，竞争大，且亥子丑会水局，身更旺，财星受克，不利求财。\n\n综合看，2018戊戌年，大运丙辰，流年戊戌，辰戌冲，冲动财库，且戊土七杀为事业星，丙火偏财为投资，土旺为房地产、酒店等不动产领域。但选项中有2018房地产和2019酒店，需细辨：2018年戌土为火库，火为财，但戌为燥土，更偏向房产建筑；2019己亥年水旺克火，财星受损，且亥水为流动，酒店住宿属水，但财星受克，故不成立。因此2018年出国创业，领域为房地产。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_1_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5814, "response_id": "227ad86e-8671-4994-b15c-b9edaeb9b98a", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 241, "completion_tokens": 456, "total_tokens": 697, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 113}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disab