{"case_id": "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q31", "domain": "family", "question": "命主原生家庭父母亲状况？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，年柱为戊辰，月柱为甲寅，日柱为庚子，时柱为甲申。日主庚金生于寅月，木旺金囚，月干甲木偏财透出，年干戊土偏印生身，但地支寅木与申金相冲，时支申金为日主之根，但被月支寅木冲克，根基不稳。\n\n原生家庭看年柱与月柱。年柱戊辰，戊土偏印为母星，辰土为父星（偏财之库），但月柱甲寅为偏财，偏财旺而克印，且甲木与戊土相克（甲克戊），暗示父母关系紧张。月支寅木为偏财之根，与年支辰土无直接合会，但寅申冲（月支与时支），时柱为子女宫，冲则家庭动荡。年干戊土偏印被月干甲木克制，母亲受制；年支辰土为父星，但被月支寅木克制（寅木克辰土），父亲亦受制。\n\n综合来看，父母星均受克，且月柱偏财旺而克印，主父母感情不和，易有离异之象。时柱甲申，申为庚金之根，但被寅冲，暗示命主可能随父或随母，但年柱为根，月柱为苗，年干戊土偏印（母）被克，年支辰土（父）亦被克，但月柱偏财（父）力量更强，且时柱甲木亦为偏财（父星），故可能随父亲。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q31", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2025_b1a_prime_1_g3\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5935, "response_id": "16fc9b8b-d934-40d6-b1c0-3590c4a1b597", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 223, "completion_tokens": 370, "total_tokens": 593, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 95}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
